          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩtina woo Melatia Mũngiveoni, na Yatoni Mũmelonothi, andũ ma Ngiveoni, na ma Misiva, matũngĩĩa, ala ma kĩvĩla kya ũsumbĩ kya ngavana mũingo wa ũla Ũsĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩtina woo Usieli mwana wa Aliaia, wa atwii ma thaavu, atũngĩĩa. Na ĩtina wake Aanania ũmwe wa aseũvya ma manukato atũngĩĩa, nao malũlũmĩlya Yelusaleme o kũvika ũvai mũthanthau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩtina woo Lavaia mwana wa Uulu atũngĩĩa, mũsumbĩki wa nyunzu ya kĩvalo kya Yelusaleme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩtina woo Yetaia mwana wa Alumavu atũngĩĩa, kwelekela nyũmba yake. Na ĩtina wake Atusi mwana wa Asavineia atũngĩĩa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malikiya mwana wa Alimu, na Asuvu mwana wa Vaathi‐moavi, matũngĩĩa kĩlungu kĩngĩ, na mwako mũtũlu wa mũnyoolo wĩ maiko manene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩtina wake Salumu mwana wa Aloesi, mũsumbĩki wa nyunzu ya kĩvalo kya Yelusaleme, atũngĩĩa, we na eĩtu make.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
