        },
        {
          "text": "Na Malikiya mwana wa Lekavi, mũsumbĩki wa kĩvalo kya Mbethi‐akelemu, atũngĩĩa mbingĩlo ya kumĩlya vũũ; amyaka, na aũngamya mĩomo yayo, na eekĩa ivingi syayo, na ivingo syayo.",
