            "sid": "NEH 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Na ĩndĩ Anethini nĩmatũaa Oveli, kũvika vandũ velekele mbingĩlo ya manzĩ kwelekela wumĩlonĩ wa syũa, na mwako mũtũlu wa mũnyoolo ũla wumĩlĩte.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
