          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Athembi matũngĩĩa ĩũlũ wa mbingĩlo ya mbalasi, kĩla ũmwe kwelekela nyũmba yake mwene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩtina woo Nzatoki mwana wa Imeli atũngĩĩa kwelekela nyũmba yake mwene. Na ĩtina wake Semaia mwana wa Sekania, mũsũvĩi wa mbingĩlonĩ ya ngalĩ ya wumĩlonĩ wa syũa, atũngĩĩa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩtina wake Aanania mwana wa Selemia, na Anuni mwana wa thanthatũ wa Nzalavi, matũngĩĩa kĩlungu kĩngĩ. Na ĩtina wake Mesulamu mwana wa Mbelekia atũngĩia kwelekela kasũmba kake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
